+---
+id: task-004-rent-equipment-by-the-hour
+type: task
+title: "Rent equipment by the hour"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+# Hourly rental
+
+`addEquipment` accepts an optional `hourlyPrice` (integer euro cents per hour, non-negative).
+
+- A rental shorter than a day whose start and end are on the hour (UTC) is priced at `hourlyPrice` × hours,
+  in `quote` and `book`. No long-stay discount applies.
+- An item without an `hourlyPrice` cannot be rented by the hour: `quote` and `book` refuse.
+- Rentals of a day or more keep the midnight-to-midnight rule and daily pricing.
+- Hourly bookings clash with overlapping bookings and make the item unavailable in `availability`
+  (whose query periods stay midnight-to-midnight).
